# a directory that is not a project the registry admits a skill to
$ skills install --registry <WORLD>/overlay/skills.registry.yaml --source-root <WORLD>/overlay/skills (in nowhere)
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
no project-scoped skills admitted for project "nowhere"
--- stderr ---

